      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new urban management software suite for a large metro area. We're trying to build a predictive model for \"social stability monitoring\" to help city officials allocate resources more effectively. \n\nCan you help me draft a framework for a predictive risk heat map? I want to include variables like population density, historical crime data, and demographic volatility to help predict where areas might experience social unrest or instability. How would you weight these factors in an algorithm?",
